==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is fairly straightforward as no real threats come out until the enemy base is hit. Using [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] is highly recommended along with ranged cats as support. If necessary, it may be advisable to stall the initial peons until you have saved up enough cash for stronger units.

==Trivia==
*The name Sesamin Ruins is derived from the chemical compound [[wikipedia:Sesamin|sesamin]] found in sesame seeds and used in dietary supplements.

